# anthropic_model (Data Source)

Retrieves a specific Anthropic model by ID or alias.

> **API**: `GET /v1/models/{id}` (Models API).
> **Auth**: Standard API key (`api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

